      "content": "look i get the policy thing but we aren't trying to scam people, we're just trying to market the \"limited edition\" aspect. the whole point of a limited line is that it's not meant to be infinite. if i say \"only a few left\" it just creates the vibe of the collection being exclusive. can u try again but maybe include some specific numbers to make it really hit home? like \"less than 20 units remaining\" or something like that? it needs to feel real if we're gonna get the conversion spike we need.",
